  "details": "You can block users who you do not wish to see, it would be great if you were able to block worlds. This would simply prevent a world from being shown to you in the explore worlds menu (Variety box, New and trending etc). Of course it would still show up when manually searching for worlds using the search function. If friends are in a world, then in the social tab it could just show the friend as being in a private world. But that's less important. It's mostly about being in control of whether a specific world is served to you on the worlds tab.",
